[I] Implementation of the meson language written in C11

[T] boson is an implementation of the meson build system language written in
[T] C11, focusing on portability and simplicity. It requires only POSIX
[T] interfaces and a C11 compiler; upstream describes it as a work in
[T] progress.

[U] https://git.sr.ht/~bl4ckb0ne/boson

[A] Boson Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS

[V] 0.1
[L] GPL3

